data: {"type": "text", "text": "### Documented pairings for the H2-10K-T3\n\nOur pairing data records no released battery pairing for the H2-10K-T3, so I cannot name a battery that is documented as released for this inverter.\n\n### What the page lists\n\nThe product page does carry compatibility records, each marked as documented by SAJ: SAJ B2-10.0-HV1, SAJ B2-15.0-HV1, SAJ B2-20.0-HV1, SAJ B2-25.0-HV1, SAJ BC2-HV1 and SAJ BU2-5.0-HV1.\n\n- The page describes the H2 system as H2 + BC2 + BU2.\n- It notes that the one-module B2-5.0 is not covered, because its operating voltage lies below the battery voltage range of the H2 T3.\n- These page records are documentation, not a released pairing verdict, so please treat them as reference only.\n\nThe configuration instructions for the H2 systems are linked below.", "refs": ["page"]}

